470
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,840
Everyone else just gets the word.

471
00:23:42,840 --> 00:23:44,720
Everyone takes turns telling a story.

472
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,200
Those without the real meaning

473
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:47,400
have to make something up

474
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:49,200
and convince everyone

475
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,400
their explanation is right.

476
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:53,040
This round's phrase is "a yue hun zi".
[*Pistachio]

477
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:54,680
