482
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,360
("A yue hun zi")
Is that an idiom?

483
00:24:02,360 --> 00:24:04,080
Could be a Chinese herb.

484
00:24:04,080 --> 00:24:05,160
Or a type of wood.

485
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,240
Or maybe it literally means

486
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,200
A Yue is a slacker.

487
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,040
Could be!

488
00:24:08,600 --> 00:24:09,400
Just make stuff up.

489
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:10,640
Let's play!

490
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:12,280
Just have fun with it!

491
