506
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:46,560
So, here's the thing.

507
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:48,680
The "a" isn't pronounced "a".

508
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:50,160
It's pronounced "e".

509
00:24:50,160 --> 00:24:53,320
"E" means the first month of the year.

510
00:24:53,320 --> 00:24:54,520
("A" is pronounced "e"
and means January)

511
00:24:54,520 --> 00:24:56,040
"Hun" means chaos.

512
00:24:56,040 --> 00:24:57,600
Back in ancient times, lots of kids

513
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:59,720
were always sleepy.

514
00:24:59,720 --> 00:25:01,600
So people started using it

515
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:02,920
to describe kids who weren't too bright.

516
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,200
(Wang Anyu's version of "a yue hun zi":)
They called them that.

517
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:05,400
(Old slang for a dumb kid)
For example,

518
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:08,400
when we play Werewolf,

519
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:10,480
someone who keeps killing the good guys

520
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:11,400
could be called

521
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:12,640
"a yue hun zi".
[*A dumb kid]

522
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:14,140
(Who're you talking about?)

523
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:17,560
Isn't that what people back home

524
00:25:18,280 --> 00:25:19,280
