1544
00:58:04,120 --> 00:58:05,640
I can't escape this.

1545
00:58:09,000 --> 00:58:09,840
Should probably add some water.

1546
00:58:11,440 --> 00:58:12,000
Sorry about this.

1547
00:58:12,000 --> 00:58:12,320
I'm not holding back.

1548
00:58:12,320 --> 00:58:12,760
Come on.

1549
00:58:12,760 --> 00:58:13,280
Let's do it.

1550
00:58:13,280 --> 00:58:14,480
Let's finish with a bang.

1551
00:58:15,800 --> 00:58:16,200
Three!

1552
00:58:17,100 --> 00:58:18,540
(Listening carefully)

1553
00:58:21,840 --> 00:58:22,200
Two!

1554
00:58:22,600 --> 00:58:24,720
Someone who's all looks and no brains.

1555
00:58:26,880 --> 00:58:27,240
One!

1556
00:58:31,780 --> 00:58:32,940
(Ouch)

1557
00:58:35,580 --> 00:58:37,300
(Seriously hurting
but keeping a straight face)

1558
00:58:37,840 --> 00:58:38,920
(Correct guess)
Not bad.

1559
00:58:38,920 --> 00:58:39,520
Pretty good.

1560
00:58:40,640 --> 00:58:41,600
Not a good aim. Let's try again.

1561
00:58:42,040 --> 00:58:42,720
What the heck?

1562
00:58:44,760 --> 00:58:45,320
Doesn't hurt, right?

1563
00:58:47,920 --> 00:58:48,920
Here, I'll turn it over again.

1564
00:58:52,160 --> 00:58:53,400
Sorry.

1565
00:58:53,680 --> 00:58:55,760
Alright, let her get it out of her system.

1566
00:58:55,760 --> 00:58:56,290
("He hua da shao"
is old Shanghai slang,)

1567
00:58:56,290 --> 00:58:56,770
(referring to rich playboys in silk shirts
and strolled through gardens in summer.)

1568
00:58:56,770 --> 00:58:57,100
(who carried fans
and strolled through gardens in summer.)

1569
00:58:57,100 --> 00:58:57,870
(Like lotuses that bloom only in summer,
these men only showed off in hot weather,)

1570
00:58:57,880 --> 00:58:58,700
(a term mocking those who look
impressive but are empty-headed.)

1571
00:59:01,560 --> 00:59:02,760
Let's go!

1572
00:59:02,760 --> 00:59:03,560
So happy!

1573
00:59:03,560 --> 00:59:04,760
We're getting better together.

1574
00:59:05,240 --> 00:59:06,280
We're more in sync every time.

1575
00:59:06,960 --> 00:59:07,600
You bet!

1576
00:59:07,600 --> 00:59:08,960
They don't call me
the versatile Michelin Bing

1577
00:59:08,960 --> 00:59:10,000
