1578
00:59:10,000 --> 00:59:10,560
Bing,

1579
00:59:11,320 --> 00:59:12,480
I wasn't talking about us two.

1580
00:59:13,920 --> 00:59:15,000
I meant me and this!

1581
00:59:16,120 --> 00:59:19,040
Yili Pure Milk! It goes with everything!

1582
00:59:19,440 --> 00:59:20,560
Oh, I know it well!

1583
00:59:20,560 --> 00:59:22,240
I've teamed up
with Yili plenty of times!

1584
00:59:22,240 --> 00:59:24,480
Why didn't you bring me along sooner?

1585
00:59:24,480 --> 00:59:26,240
Well, we're together this time.

1586
00:59:26,240 --> 00:59:27,720
Let's head out together with Yili.

1587
00:59:27,720 --> 00:59:28,400
Let's team up more.

1588
00:59:28,800 --> 00:59:29,520
What's the plan this time?

1589
00:59:29,520 --> 00:59:30,880
Games, of course.

1590
00:59:31,600 --> 00:59:32,760
The perfect match.

1591
00:59:36,280 --> 00:59:37,440
Cheers!

1592
00:59:44,440 --> 00:59:44,880
Time to eat!

1593
00:59:45,240 --> 00:59:46,240
You little foodie!

1594
00:59:46,340 --> 00:59:47,620
(Lobster mapo tofu)

1595
00:59:47,660 --> 00:59:48,260
(Vegetable salad,
crispy Sichuan pepper beef ribs)

1596
00:59:48,260 --> 00:59:48,860
(Veal with Erjingtiao chilies,
