1597
00:59:48,900 --> 00:59:49,980
(Spicy yak meat and offal salad)

1598
00:59:50,020 --> 00:59:50,440
(Paper-thin spicy yak beef)

1599
00:59:50,440 --> 00:59:51,000
This is delicious.

1600
00:59:51,180 --> 00:59:52,780
(Grilled beef skewers)
I can tell.

1601
00:59:52,820 --> 00:59:53,400
(Grilled Tibetan pork skewers)

1602
00:59:53,400 --> 00:59:55,840
I don't know why, but this long table

1603
00:59:55,840 --> 00:59:57,320
reminds me of that place...

1604
00:59:57,320 --> 00:59:58,480
Where was it we went?

1605
00:59:58,480 --> 01:00:00,560
Italy!

1606
01:00:00,560 --> 01:00:02,560
My home overseas?

1607
01:00:04,360 --> 01:00:05,200
Time to dig in!

1608
01:00:05,200 --> 01:00:05,600
Let's eat!

1609
01:00:17,760 --> 01:00:18,400
What's this?

1610
01:00:18,840 --> 01:00:19,320
Beef jerky.

1611
01:00:22,240 --> 01:00:23,000
It's sweet.

1612
01:00:24,660 --> 01:00:25,940
(Satisfied)

1613
01:00:36,000 --> 01:00:37,440
If you don't want a whole skewer,

1614
01:00:37,440 --> 01:00:37,840
