1615
01:00:37,840 --> 01:00:38,400
Sure.

1616
01:00:38,400 --> 01:00:38,760
Okay?

1617
01:00:38,760 --> 01:00:39,580
(Sharing a skewer)

1618
01:00:44,900 --> 01:00:45,820
(A big thumbs-up)

1619
01:00:45,840 --> 01:00:46,480
Grab me a piece.

1620
01:00:48,000 --> 01:00:48,400
That's enough.

1621
01:00:52,220 --> 01:00:53,740
(Officially approved)

1622
01:00:54,360 --> 01:00:54,800
Want some?

1623
01:00:54,940 --> 01:00:56,820
(Recommending it to everyone)

1624
01:00:57,200 --> 01:00:57,600
This is really good.

1625
01:00:58,040 --> 01:00:58,640
Just a small piece.

1626
01:01:00,360 --> 01:01:01,160
Want another piece?

1627
01:01:01,160 --> 01:01:01,640
I'm good.

1628
01:01:01,640 --> 01:01:02,080
You're good?

1629
01:01:02,080 --> 01:01:03,120
I'm gonna have a skewer.

1630
01:01:03,120 --> 01:01:03,440
Okay.

1631
01:01:09,320 --> 01:01:10,120
Who's tried this beef?

1632
01:01:10,120 --> 01:01:10,640
Is it good?

1633
01:01:11,280 --> 01:01:11,840
I have.

1634
01:01:11,840 --> 01:01:12,200
It's good.

1635
01:01:12,200 --> 01:01:12,900
(Tried and approved)

1636
01:01:13,160 --> 01:01:14,080
Then why'd you stop?

1637
01:01:14,440 --> 01:01:14,960
I'm full.

1638
01:01:15,060 --> 01:01:16,380
(Fair enough)

1639
01:01:16,880 --> 01:01:17,860
Hu, grab us a handful.

1640
01:01:17,860 --> 01:01:18,500
(Jingyu wants some)

1641
01:01:18,900 --> 01:01:20,220
(Jingyu gets some)

1642
01:01:20,400 --> 01:01:20,840
I'll take one.

1643
01:01:20,840 --> 01:01:21,120
Thanks.

1644
01:01:26,680 --> 01:01:27,320
I can't eat anymore.

1645
01:01:27,780 --> 01:01:28,840
(Stomach 99.99% full)
My eyes still want more,

1646
01:01:28,840 --> 01:01:29,760
but my stomach...

1647
01:01:29,760 --> 01:01:30,520
Then eat with your eyes.

1648
01:01:30,700 --> 01:01:32,260
(Feasting with her eyes)

1649
01:01:32,560 --> 01:01:33,280
I'm stuffed!

1650
01:01:35,360 --> 01:01:39,040
What an unforgettable night!

1651
01:01:39,060 --> 01:01:40,360
(Chased cows in the morning,
played cows in the afternoon)

1652
01:01:40,360 --> 01:01:41,680
Good night, everyone!

1653
01:01:41,680 --> 01:01:43,740
(Talking bull at night.
What a moo-velous day!)

1654
01:02:27,300 --> 01:02:28,380
(Next episode)
Dumb Assassin.

1655
01:02:28,400 --> 01:02:30,280
Only the boss has the target list.

1656
01:02:30,280 --> 01:02:32,240
The boss must stay undercover

1657
01:02:32,240 --> 01:02:34,160
and secretly signal
the targets to the assassin.

1658
01:02:35,400 --> 01:02:37,400
I feel like I'm in a microwave!

1659
01:02:37,880 --> 01:02:39,400
I'm the assassin with the gun.

1660
01:02:39,840 --> 01:02:42,720
I've already identified my partner.

1661
01:02:42,960 --> 01:02:44,680
I've already found my guy!

1662
01:02:44,680 --> 01:02:46,840
(Only the boss has the real target list)
But without a signal, I can't do anything!

1663
01:02:46,840 --> 01:02:47,660
Locked and loaded!

1664
01:02:47,660 --> 01:02:48,880
Ready to strike!

1665
01:02:48,880 --> 01:02:49,760
Bing, you're out!

1666
01:02:51,680 --> 01:02:52,760
Just getting a stretch.

1667
01:02:52,760 --> 01:02:53,520
Wang Churan, you're out!

1668
01:02:54,360 --> 01:02:55,280
You're out!

1669
01:02:55,280 --> 01:02:56,640
My boss has spoken!

1670
01:02:56,960 --> 01:02:58,600
What're you waiting for?

1671
01:02:58,760 --> 01:03:00,280
Tell me who to shoot!

1672
01:03:00,280 --> 01:03:00,800
If I were you,

1673
01:03:00,800 --> 01:03:01,800
I'd shoot him first!

1674
01:03:03,380 --> 01:03:05,060
(Everyone's bluffing.
Who's the real assassin?)

1675
01:03:05,160 --> 01:03:06,080
Back in school,

1676
01:03:06,080 --> 01:03:08,360
who was most likely
to get love confessions?

1677
01:03:08,360 --> 01:03:09,280
Stand up with confidence.

1678
01:03:09,280 --> 01:03:10,200
If I were your governor,

1679
01:03:10,200 --> 01:03:11,320
I'd revoke your residency!

1680
01:03:12,840 --> 01:03:15,920
Who'd make the best kids'
clothing model?

1681
01:03:15,920 --> 01:03:17,080
Why do I feel a little tall?

1682
01:03:17,920 --> 01:03:20,840
Who's most likely
to become an evil mastermind?

1683
01:03:21,280 --> 01:03:22,480
I'm tall for this one too!

1684
01:03:22,840 --> 01:03:24,520
You think you're not evil?

1685
01:03:24,520 --> 01:03:25,840
Now you're being biased!

1686
01:03:26,080 --> 01:03:27,000
Who'd be the favorite?

1687
01:03:28,080 --> 01:03:28,880
You?

1688
01:03:28,900 --> 01:03:29,940
(What'd I do?)

1689
01:03:30,080 --> 01:03:31,400
You're not voting for me?

1690
01:03:31,680 --> 01:03:33,040
If we're going for something unusual...

1691
01:03:34,400 --> 01:03:37,520
Who's at their absolute prime?

1692
01:03:37,520 --> 01:03:38,680
Someone voted for themselves!

1693
01:03:38,680 --> 01:03:39,760
I'll tell you who.

1694
01:03:39,760 --> 01:03:41,880
You said this was an anonymous vote!

1695
01:03:43,680 --> 01:03:44,240
Tell the truth.

1696
01:03:44,240 --> 01:03:45,760
Don't let someone expose you.

1697
01:03:45,760 --> 01:03:46,400
If I tell the truth,

1698
01:03:46,400 --> 01:03:47,320
I'll turn to stone.

1699
01:03:49,620 --> 01:03:51,740
(Bonus episode preview)
How many dances does the crew have?

1700
01:03:51,740 --> 01:03:52,560
Six dances!

1701
01:03:52,560 --> 01:03:57,160
Cha-cha!

1702
01:03:57,160 --> 01:03:58,560
Switch to another dance move.

1703
01:04:00,160 --> 01:04:01,920
All I'm missing is a rolling pin.

1704
01:04:03,200 --> 01:04:04,000
How many dances does the crew have?

1705
01:04:04,000 --> 01:04:04,360
One dance!

1706
01:04:04,620 --> 01:04:04,960
(Suddenly snaps awake)

1707
01:04:04,960 --> 01:04:05,600
Who're you pointing at?

1708
01:04:07,900 --> 01:04:10,020
(Who'll win this dance showdown?)

1709
01:04:10,020 --> 01:04:11,870
Yak Finish-the-Line Challenge.

1710
01:04:12,360 --> 01:04:12,960
Hello?

1711
01:04:12,960 --> 01:04:13,780
(Somehow perfectly in sync)

1712
01:04:16,520 --> 01:04:18,200
What're you two so excited about?

1713
01:04:18,960 --> 01:04:19,880
Mom!

1714
01:04:19,880 --> 01:04:21,000
Yes, moo!

1715
01:04:21,020 --> 01:04:21,900
(Way too into character)

1716
01:04:21,900 --> 01:04:23,780
Mom!

1717
01:04:23,780 --> 01:04:25,540
Yes, moo!

1718
01:04:26,880 --> 01:04:28,520
Come with me!

1719
01:04:29,520 --> 01:04:31,440
Now you're in your element.

1720
01:04:31,440 --> 01:04:32,640
Okay, we can play along with that.

1721
01:04:32,640 --> 01:04:33,540
(Too much acting experience)

1722
01:04:37,100 --> 01:04:37,540
No.

1723
01:04:38,960 --> 01:04:39,760
Isn't that what it means?

1724
01:04:39,900 --> 01:04:41,200
(Your script isn't my script)

1725
01:04:41,200 --> 01:04:42,000
We've taken the acting too far again?

1726
01:04:42,420 --> 01:04:43,660
(Instantly getting into character)

1727
01:04:45,320 --> 01:04:46,720
She came in with that attitude.

1728
01:04:46,720 --> 01:04:48,480
I knew my place right away.

1729
01:04:48,480 --> 01:04:49,620
(Feeling small)

1730
01:04:49,660 --> 01:04:52,020
(The crew shows off their acting skills.
Let the show begin!)

1731
01:04:52,020 --> 01:05:13,260
(Natural High S4 Viewing Calendar)
